}.$" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250104 1113 #uuid "19119cab-b147-5de2-999a-940899f58d4c" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250104 1145 "First, we express $h$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nh={5}^{u},\\,u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡v\\,v=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}u}={5}^{u}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}=\\frac{1}{v},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\n$$\n\nApplying now the chain rule twice, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & ={5}^{u}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\cdot (\\frac{1}{v})\\cdot (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & ={5}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x})\\cdot (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =-{5}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we compute ${h}^{′}(0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(0) & =-{5}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\operatorname{cos}⁡0)}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{tan}⁡0 \\\\  & =-{5}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡1}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5(0) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250106 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250107 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250108 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250109 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250110 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1041 "selection" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250108 13194139533771 true] [17592186250105 1110 #uuid "f4da8a68-57fa-5444-88d2-e51880ea8d0e" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250106 1034 "-5" 131