true] [17592186250118 1113 #uuid "d323b0c1-7294-50f7-8607-7555968ab5bf" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250118 1145 "First, we express $f$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={u}^{4},\\,u=\\operatorname{cot}⁡v,\\,v=5x-1.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=4{u}^{3},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}=-{csc}^{2}⁡v,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=5.\n$$\n\nApplying now the chain rule twice, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =4{u}^{3}\\cdot (-{csc}^{2}⁡v)\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =4(\\operatorname{cot}⁡(5x-1))^{3}\\cdot (-{csc}^{2}⁡(5x-1))\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-20{cot}^{3}⁡(5x-1){csc}^{2}⁡(5x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we compute ${f}^{′}(0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(0) & =-20{cot}^{3}⁡(5(0)-1){csc}^{2}⁡(5(0)-1) \\\\  & =-20{cot}^{3}⁡(-1){csc}^{2}⁡(-1) \\\\  & =-20(-{cot}^{3}⁡1){csc}^{2}⁡1 \\\\  & =20{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250120 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250121 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250122 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250123 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250124 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1041 "selection" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250123 13194139533771 true] [17592186250119 1110 #uuid "7bd56ad7-c1af-5c1d-ba9a-73dc89fe0447" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250120 1034 "5{cot}^{3}⁡1{sec}^{2}⁡1" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250120 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533771 true] [17592186250120 1111 #uuid "6929b6fc-f997-55bb-b859-bdbf49ae687d" 13194139533771 true] [17592186250121 1034 "-4{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1" 1319413953377